Extra:
Example:
package com.example.util;
public class Helper {}
Gotcha: Placing the package statement after imports or class definitions causes a compile-time error. The folder structure must match exactly: com/example/util/Helper.java.

Example:
import static java.lang.Math.PI;
import static java.lang.Math.sqrt;
Gotcha: Writing 'static import' instead of 'import static' is a compile-time error. You must import class members, not the class itself (e.g. import static java.lang.Math; fails).
